"......"

//【雪車町】
<voice name='雪車町' class='雪車町' src='voice/ma04/0010650a12'>
//「それからなのか、最初からそうだったのか
//は知りませんが……
//　ご両所は手を組んで、代官殿の一党に対抗
//してきましてね」
"Now I don't know whether that was just dumb luck or if they were in cahoots the whole time, but afterward, they joined forces to take down the prefect."

//【雪車町】
<voice name='雪車町' class='雪車町' src='voice/ma04/0010660a12'>
//「最後はお代官と月山を誘い出して撃墜……
//したんでしょうねぇ、まぁ。
//　あたしはその前にやられっちまったんで、
//見届けちゃおりませんが」
"In the end, they managed to lure him and Gassan out and finish them. ...Least, that's how I figure things must've gone down. I was outta commission at the time, so I didn't see it myself."

pt:
//【雪車町】
<voice name='雪車町' class='雪車町' src='voice/ma04/0010650a12'>
